c{x-1}{-2}=\\frac{y-5}{-1}=\\frac{z-(-7)}{1}=t,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nSimplifying, we reach\n\n$$\n\\frac{x-1}{-2}=\\frac{y-5}{-1}=\\frac{z+7}{1}.\n$$" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343545 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343546 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343547 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343548 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343549 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1041 "selection" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343549 13194139535319 true] [17592186343544 1110 #uuid "bd54e826-0b6b-5cc5-ace9-aa00b7b0e240" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343545 1034 "\\frac{x+2}{-1}=\\frac{y-5}{-1}=\\frac{z+7}{1}" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343545 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535319 true] [17592186343545 1111 #uuid "683a1f91-97ca-5d0a-8123-29001dc443fd" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343546 1034 "\\frac{x+1}{-2}=\\frac{y-5}{-1}=\\frac{z-7}{1}" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343546 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535319 true] [17592186343546 1111 #uuid "3897fd54-276a-5ac3-bc8b-8fd562da2978" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343547 1034 "\\frac{x-2}{1}=\\frac{y+1}{-5}=\\frac{z-1}{-7}" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343547 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535319 true] [17592186343547 1111 #uuid "3142d4df-83f3-5b3e-b02e-b019a6a51a98" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343548 1034 "\\frac{x+2}{1}=\\frac{y+1}{5}=\\frac{z-1}{-7}" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343548 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535319 true] [17592186343548 1111 #uuid "6d1be165-4655-58ac-9314-66221f485807" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343549 1034 "\\frac{x-1}{-2}=\\frac{y-5}{-1}=\\frac{z+7}{1}" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343549 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535319 true] [17592186343549 1111 #uuid "dd2c85dd-97d4-5591-a4ff-64505c1f57a5" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343550 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343551 13194139535319 true] [17592186343550 1089 "q-127410" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343550 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535319 true] [17592186343550 1100 "Consider the straight line with the parametric equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=3-2t \\\\ y=-5t \\\\ z=1-t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ Find the Cartesian equation of this line." 13194139535319 true] [17592186343550 1113 #uuid "57e97057-e8bc-5a18-a1e1-2b43855aa175" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343550 1145 "First, let's find the corresponding vector equation as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3-2t \\\\ -5t \\\\ 1-t\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-2t \\\\ -5t \\\\ -t\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ r & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nThis implies that the given line passes through the point $P(3,0,1)$ and is parallel to the vector $v=⟨-2,-5,-1⟩.$ So, its Cartesian (canonical) equation is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{x-3}{-2}=\\frac{y-0}{-5}=\\frac{z-1}{-1}=t,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nSimplifying, we reach\n\n$$\n\\frac{x-3}{-2}=\\frac{y}{-5}=\\frac{z-1}{-1}.\n$$" 13194139535319 true] [17592186343551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343552 13194139535319 true] [17592186343551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343553 13194139535319 true] [17592186343551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343554 13194139535319 true] [17592186343551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343555 13194139535319 true] [17592186343551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343556 13194139535319 true] [17592186343551 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535319 true] [17592186